    fix(deps): add 8 missing runtime deps to pyproject.toml (REV-2)
    
    pyproject [project].dependencies omitted requests, numpy, Pillow,
    opencv-python-headless, psutil, fastapi, uvicorn, websockets — all
    imported by tracked runtime code (src/, web_viewer.py, ram_map_server.py,
    cron_runner) and pinned in requirements.txt. A pip install -e . consumer
    got ModuleNotFoundError at import. Dev extras already carried opencv/
    psutil/fastapi (b11aebf) but runtime installs following pyproject alone
    were broken.
    
    Verified: fresh uv venv (py3.11) + `uv pip install -e .` resolves and all
    9 runtime modules import cleanly.
    
    Closes REV-2 (ai-plays-poke board tick 2026-10-02-09-28-39)
